# Haven posts: the slides and Reels are rendered on demand (node share/posts/render.js <post>) and
# handed over in the session, so they stay out of the public history. Each post keeps its source,
# its caption, and sheet.jpg or cover.jpg as the record of how it looked.
share/posts/*/[0-9][0-9].jpg
share/posts/*/reel.mp4
